  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESEAU NIG/GESTION NON VIOLENTE CON</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Nigerien network for non-violent conflict management (re-GENOVICO) is a Nigerien law association recognized by order No. 163/MI/SD/AR/DGAPJ/DLP of April 06, 2010. By its status the GENOVICO network is a non-partisan, non-denominational, nonprofit association.
The GENOVICO network is present throughout the national territory through the &quot;regional groups&quot; at the level of the 7 regions and the city of Niamey.
It is coordinated by a National Coordinating Committee based in Niamey, headquarters of the network.
The GENOVICOnetwork is involved in conflict prevention and management and promote peace and non violence.</narrative>
  </participating-org>
